Description: small retro libretro frontend
 piccolo plays games through libretro cores, with the look of the classic
 emulator frontends of the 90s: pick a core, pick a game, play. It has
 shader presets (librashader), controller mapping, save states, rewind and
 netplay. The Test libretro core comes with it.
 .
 Settings and saves live in ~/.local/share/piccolo.
